; shell32.def — W32APP_PLAN.md phase W32A-10: import library surface.
; Every export of the w32 shell32 engine (w32/src/shell32.c or w32aux.c):
; the 19 ledger symbols for SHELL32.dll.  Kept in lockstep
; with w32/src/w32_bind.c.
